    "excerpt": "Gathering Dojang Sriwijaya",
    "content": "<p></p><p>Keseruan&nbsp;momen&nbsp;<em>Family&nbsp;Gathering&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Fun&nbsp;Games</em>&nbsp;Dojang&nbsp;Sriwijaya&nbsp;di&nbsp;akhir&nbsp;pekan&nbsp;kemarin!&nbsp;Mulai&nbsp;dari&nbsp;lomba&nbsp;tarik&nbsp;tambang&nbsp;antar-wali&nbsp;murid,&nbsp;<em>games</em>&nbsp;kekompakan&nbsp;bersama&nbsp;para&nbsp;pelatih,&nbsp;hingga&nbsp;santap&nbsp;tumpeng&nbsp;bersama.&nbsp;</p><p>Terima&nbsp;kasih&nbsp;banyak&nbsp;untuk&nbsp;seluruh&nbsp;orang&nbsp;tua&nbsp;siswa&nbsp;atas&nbsp;kehangatan&nbsp;dan&nbsp;kekompakannya.&nbsp;Sinergi&nbsp;yang&nbsp;kuat&nbsp;antara&nbsp;pelatih,&nbsp;murid,&nbsp;dan&nbsp;orang&nbsp;tua&nbsp;adalah&nbsp;kunci&nbsp;utama&nbsp;keberhasilan&nbsp;anak-anak&nbsp;kita.&nbsp;Sampai&nbsp;jumpa&nbsp;di&nbsp;agenda&nbsp;kebersamaan&nbsp;berikutnya!&nbsp;🙌🎉&nbsp;</p><p></p><p>#FamilyGathering&nbsp;#DojangFamily&nbsp;#Kebersamaan&nbsp;#FunGames&nbsp;#TaekwondoCommunity</p>",
